  MT=2  Elastic scattering                                        8931 1451
    Calculated with CCONE code/6/.                                8931 1451
                                                                  8931 1451
  MT=18 Fission                                                   8931 1451
    Isotropic distributions in the laboratory system were assumed.8931 1451
