MF=31 Covariances of average number of neutrons per fission       8931 1451
  MT=452 Number of neutrons per fission                           8931 1451
    Sum of covariances for MT=455 and MT=456.                     8931 1451
                                                                  8931 1451
  MT=455                                                          8931 1451
    Error of 15% was assumed.                                     8931 1451
                                                                  8931 1451
  MT=456                                                          8931 1451
    Covariance was obtained by fitting a linear function to the   8931 1451
    at 0.0 and 5.0 MeV with an uncertainty of 5%.                 8931 1451
