MF=33 Covariances of neutron cross sections                       8931 1451
  Covariances were given to all the cross sections by using       8931 1451
  KALMAN code/13/ and the covariances of model parameters         8931 1451
  used in the cross-section calculations.                         8931 1451
                                                                  8931 1451
  Covariances of the fission cross section were determined from   8931 1451
  experimental data.                                              8931 1451
                                                                  8931 1451
  For the following cross sections, standard deviations in the    8931 1451
  energy region below 0.6 eV were assumed as follows:             8931 1451
                                                                  8931 1451
     Total                2.9 %                                   8931 1451
     Elastic scattering  50 %                                     8931 1451
